@saga = http://localhost:5220
@catalog = http://localhost:5152

### 1. Happy path: registration completes (exp. 202 Accepted)
POST {{saga}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Коваленко Ірина Петрівна",
  "email": "iryna@example.com",
  "phone": "+380991112233",
  "city": "Дніпро"
}

### 2. Compensation path: activation fails, profile deleted (exp. 202 Accepted)
POST {{saga}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Тестов Тест Тестович",
  "email": "test@fail.test",
  "phone": "+380500000000",
  "city": "Київ"
}

### 3. Check the list after both runs (happy client present, compensated client absent)
GET {{catalog}}/api/v1/clients?sort=-id&page=1&pageSize=10